  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Norec, FK Norway, personnell exchange</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">INCREASED AWARENESS ABOUT GLOBAL HEALTH RISKS AND CLIMATE-RESILIENT HEALTH SYSTEMS AMONG NURSING PROFESSIONALS. The purpose of the project is to increase awareness, competence and knowledge about global health risks and climate-resilient health systems among future nurses, and strengthen the knowledge and qualifications regarding this topic among teachers in higher education, as well as clinical instructors. Students will be better prepared for facing current and future health challenges with a more robust and relevant learning background. Benefits from staff- and student exchange affecting all target groups also include explorations and experiences of cultural differences, seeing new horizons and gaining personal development.</narrative>
  </description>
